---
title: "Fachberatung"
eyebrow: "Wissen für den Garten"
lead: "Workshops und spannende Gartenthemen von unserer Fachberatung."
description: "Fachberatung des KGV Sorgenfrei e.V.: Workshops, Mischkultur-Tipps, der Leitfaden Bienen und Insekten sowie Phänologie im Klimawandel."
layout: layouts/page.njk
---

<h2>Workshoptermine 2026</h2>
<p>{{ fachberatung.workshops.intro }}</p>
<ul class="not-prose mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 gap-y-4">
  {% for workshop in fachberatung.workshops.items %}
  <li>
    <span class="rounded-sm bg-leaf-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-leaf-800">{{ workshop.date }}</span>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-coal-500">Weitere Informationen gibt es bei den <a href="/termine/">Terminen</a>.</p>

<h2>Themen</h2>
<div class="not-prose mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
  {% for topic in fachberatung.topics %}
  <a href="{{ topic.url }}" class="card rounded-sm group flex flex-col overflow-hidden">
    <div class="aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden">
      {% image topic.image, topic.title, "h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105", "(min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" %}
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6">
      <h3 class="mt-0 text-lg font-semibold text-leaf-800">{{ topic.title }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-coal-600">{{ topic.summary }}</p>
      <span class="mt-auto self-start pt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-leaf-700">Mehr erfahren →</span>
    </div>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Weiterführende Links</h2>
<ul class="not-prose mt-6 space-y-4">
  {% for link in fachberatung.links %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ link.url }}" rel="noopener" class="card block p-5">
      <span class="text-base font-semibold text-leaf-700 underline decoration-leaf-300 underline-offset-2">{{ link.title }}</span>
      <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-coal-600">{{ link.description }}</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
